Package: xios-x11
Name: Xios Desktop (X11)
Version: 0.1.1
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: Max Leiter <maxwell.leiter@gmail.com>
Author: Max Leiter <maxwell.leiter@gmail.com>
Section: Desktop
Priority: optional
Depends: firmware (>= 16.5), xios-core, xwayland, xauth
MinimumOSVersion: 16.5.0
Description: the X11 flavor for Xios
 GPU-accelerated X11 compatibility through rootless Xwayland inside the iosc
 compositor. This is the compatibility flavor for software that predates
 Wayland without making the legacy software-rendered bare Xios server part of
 the default desktop.
 .
 The original xios-server package remains separately installable for legacy
 bring-up and diagnostics.
 .
 Xvfb and TigerVNC remain separately installable for explicitly headless or
 remote-display setups.
 .
 Needs iOS 16.5 or newer. Target profile: @REPO_PROFILE@.
